---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Free DMV Deck Planning Checklist | Maryland Virginia Washington DC"
  description="Free homeowner deck planning checklist for Maryland, Northern Virginia, and Washington DC. Organize site information, permits, design decisions, budget, and documents before professional deck design."
>
  <div class="checklist-page">
    <section class="checklist-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">FREE DMV HOMEOWNER RESOURCE</p>
      <h1>DMV Deck Planning Checklist</h1>
      <p class="region">Maryland • Northern Virginia • Washington DC</p>
      <p>Use this checklist to organize your deck project before requesting professional plans or construction pricing.</p>
      <button class="primary-button no-print" type="button" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF</button>
    </section>

    <section class="notice">
      <strong>Important:</strong> Permit, zoning, setback, HOA, structural, and inspection requirements vary by jurisdiction. Use this checklist to prepare, then confirm current requirements with the authority having jurisdiction for your property.
    </section>

    <section class="worksheet">
      <h2>1. Property & Site Information</h2>
      <label>Property Address: ______________________________________________</label>
      <label>City / County: _________________________________________________</label>
      <label>State: ☐ Maryland &nbsp;&nbsp; ☐ Virginia &nbsp;&nbsp; ☐ Washington DC</label>
      <label>☐ Property survey / plat located</label>
      <label>☐ Property lines and approximate setbacks identified</label>
      <label>☐ Existing deck / porch / structure photographed</label>
      <label>☐ House exterior and proposed deck connection photographed</label>
      <label>☐ Grade changes, trees, utilities, HVAC, drainage, or other obstacles noted</label>
      <label>☐ Access to the proposed work area considered</label>

      <h2>2. Deck Goals & Intended Use</h2>
      <label>☐ Dining & outdoor meals</label>
      <label>☐ Entertaining / gatherings</label>
      <label>☐ Grilling / outdoor kitchen</label>
      <label>☐ Lounge / relaxing</label>
      <label>☐ Pool / hot tub area</label>
      <label>☐ Other: _______________________________________________________</label>
      <label>Desired deck location: __________________________________________</label>
      <label>Approximate size or dimensions: __________________________________</label>

      <h2>3. Layout, Access & Safety</h2>
      <label>☐ Preferred deck shape identified</label>
      <label>☐ Door location and house connection considered</label>
      <label>☐ Stair locations considered</label>
      <label>☐ Stair landing / grade conditions considered</label>
      <label>☐ Guard / railing locations considered</label>
      <label>☐ Privacy needs considered</label>
      <label>☐ Lighting and electrical needs identified</label>
      <label>☐ Accessibility needs considered, if applicable</label>

      <h2>4. Materials & Appearance</h2>
      <label>☐ Pressure-treated wood</label>
      <label>☐ Composite decking</label>
      <label>☐ Other material: ______________________________________________</label>
      <label>Preferred color / finish: _________________________________________</label>
      <label>☐ Existing house exterior and architecture considered</label>
      <label>☐ Railing style considered</label>
      <label>☐ Fascia / trim / skirting preferences considered</label>

      <h2>5. Documents to Gather</h2>
      <label>☐ Property survey / plat</label>
      <label>☐ Existing deck or house plans, if available</label>
      <label>☐ Prior permits, if available</label>
      <label>☐ HOA / architectural-control requirements, if applicable</label>
      <label>☐ Property photos</label>
      <label>☐ Site measurements</label>
      <label>☐ Relevant zoning or setback information</label>
      <label>☐ Easement or utility information, if known</label>

      <h2>6. DMV Permit & Jurisdiction Preparation</h2>
      <div class="jurisdiction-grid">
        <div><h3>Maryland</h3><p>☐ Identify the county or municipality<br>☐ Confirm local deck permit requirements<br>☐ Check zoning / setback requirements<br>☐ Check HOA requirements, if applicable<br>☐ Confirm required drawings and inspections</p></div>
        <div><h3>Virginia</h3><p>☐ Identify the city / county<br>☐ Confirm local deck permit requirements<br>☐ Check zoning / setback requirements<br>☐ Check HOA requirements, if applicable<br>☐ Confirm required drawings and inspections</p></div>
        <div><h3>Washington DC</h3><p>☐ Confirm DC permit requirements for the property<br>☐ Check zoning / setback requirements<br>☐ Check historic-district considerations, if applicable<br>☐ Check HOA / community requirements, if applicable<br>☐ Confirm required drawings and inspections</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="small">Requirements can change and may differ by address. This checklist is preparation guidance, not legal or permitting advice.</p>

      <h2>7. Budget & Priorities</h2>
      <label>Target overall project budget: $_______________________________</label>
      <label>☐ Separate design / permit costs from construction costs</label>
      <label>☐ Identify must-have features</label>
      <label>☐ Identify nice-to-have features</label>
      <label>☐ Consider stairs, railings, lighting, privacy, and specialty features</label>
      <label>Target project timing: ____________________________________________</label>

      <h2>8. Questions for Your Deck Designer</h2>
      <div class="lines">
        <div>________________________________________________________________________</div>
        <div>________________________________________________________________________</div>
        <div>________________________________________________________________________</div>
        <div>________________________________________________________________________</div>
        <div>________________________________________________________________________</div>
        <div>________________________________________________________________________</div>
      </div>

      <h2>9. Ready for Professional Design?</h2>
      <label>☐ I have property photos and basic site information</label>
      <label>☐ I have identified my preferred deck location and use</label>
      <label>☐ I have gathered available surveys / HOA documents</label>
      <label>☐ I have identified my target budget and priorities</label>
      <label>☐ I am ready to discuss professional deck design and permit-ready plans</label>
    </section>

    <section class="kit-callout no-print">
      <p class="eyebrow">WANT THE COMPLETE WORKBOOK?</p>
      <h2>Go Further With the $49 Deck Planning Kit</h2>
      <p>The complete kit expands your planning with a more detailed homeowner workbook and project-planning tools.</p>
      <a class="primary-button" href="/deck-planning-kit/">Get the Complete Kit — $49</a>
    </section>

    <section class="professional-next no-print">
      <h2>Ready for Professional Deck Plans?</h2>
      <p>When you're ready to move from planning to professional design, explore DMV Deck Designs packages.</p>
      <a class="secondary-button" href="/purchase/">View Professional Design Packages</a>
    </section>
  </div>

  <style>
    .checklist-page{max-width:1050px;margin:0 auto;padding:30px 20px 70px;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#172033}.checklist-hero{text-align:center;padding:55px 15px 35px}.eyebrow{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.checklist-hero h1{font-family:Oswald,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.4rem);line-height:1;margin:10px 0}.region{font-weight:700;font-size:1.2rem}.checklist-hero p:not(.eyebrow):not(.region){font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.7;max-width:760px;margin:18px auto 25px}.primary-button,.secondary-button{display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border:0;cursor:pointer}.notice{padding:18px 20px;border-left:5px solid #173a70;background:#f2f5f9;line-height:1.6;margin:20px 0 30px}.worksheet{border:1px solid #d7dce4;padding:35px 38px;background:#fff}.worksheet h2{font-family:Oswald,sans-serif;font-size:1.7rem;margin:32px 0 15px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:2px solid #d7dce4}.worksheet h2:first-child{margin-top:0}.worksheet label{display:block;line-height:1.75;margin:7px 0}.jurisdiction-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.jurisdiction-grid div{border:1px solid #d7dce4;padding:18px}.jurisdiction-grid h3{font-family:Oswald,sans-serif;margin-top:0}.jurisdiction-grid p{line-height:1.7}.small{font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.6}.lines div{line-height:2.3}.kit-callout,.professional-next{text-align:center;margin:30px 0;padding:38px 25px;border-radius:10px}.kit-callout h2,.professional-next h2{font-family:Oswald,sans-serif;font-size:2rem}.kit-callout p,.professional-next p{line-height:1.7}@media(max-width:700px){.worksheet{padding:24px 18px}.jurisdiction-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.checklist-hero{padding-top:35px}}@media print{.site-header,.site-footer,.chatbot,.no-print{display:none!important}.checklist-page{padding:0;max-width:none}.worksheet{border:0;padding:0}.notice{border:1px solid #999;background:#fff}.checklist-hero{padding:0 0 15px}.worksheet h2{break-after:avoid}.jurisdiction-grid{break-inside:avoid}}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
